{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CwAqXbBDRv6RpFS2h5ejJC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tSynthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\n2\tExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\n3\tThe HTTP wrapper uses Express 4.22.2 and Node 20, with default unhandled-rejection behavior and no rejection hooks in the application. One trusted principal owns this deployment; the opaque gateway secret is not an OAuth token. Middleware gates all /mcp routes before dispatch. Session IDs are correlation handles, not delegated credentials. createTransport is a trusted external factory returning objects with handleRequest; its implementation and the deployed gateway/secret store are outside scope. Host audit, framing limits, ingress policy and process supervision require host evidence.\n4\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"727adff7-2bcc-4bf5-85be-bf0c014ca2d8","uuid":"51164ffa-5561-47a3-a8b2-44595634158b","timestamp":"2026-10-24T20:18:48.409Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-grader-5ydwg3jd/repo/README.md","content":"Synthetic source-only review component. Do not execute it or install dependencies.\nExternal runtime/deployment claims are not measurements. This repository is the complete implementation of the specific paths described below; components explicitly assigned to the host remain outside scope.\nThe HTTP wrapper uses Express 4.22.2 and Node 20, with default unhandled-rejection behavior and no rejection hooks in the application. One trusted principal owns this deployment; the opaque gateway secret is not an OAuth token. Middleware gates all /mcp routes before dispatch. Session IDs are correlation handles, not delegated credentials. createTransport is a trusted external factory returning objects with handleRequest; its implementation and the deployed gateway/secret store are outside scope. Host audit, framing limits, ingress policy and process supervision require host evidence.\n","numLines":4,"startLine":1,"totalLines":4}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CwAqXbBDRv6RpFS2h5ejJC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
